<http://data.silknow.org/object/7e113f55-50b1-34ba-8ab5-86884f757923>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Tapestry woven in silk and wool, Brussels, ca. 1690-1720"@en , "Tapestry woven in silk and wool. On the right underneath a great hanging fastened to two columns sits Spring. She is elaborately dressed and holds a bunch of flowers in her right hand, and in her left is stretched out to a large bunch of flowers at her side. Round her are five women with bunches and baskets of flowers. On the extreme right is a large vase decorated with flowers, and in the background on the left is a party of men and women dancing round a maypole in an elaborate flower garden while others look on. A gardener is seen carrying out from a house a tree in a large tub."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c2691af6-96ca-3692-879b-d738c9800eab> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9f6b3f3f-77c9-32b2-b68c-b470a5a0a3f8> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/ef4d4331-947b-35c5-a543-d01dba91c698> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/0ff66e58-d152-3d2d-add4-0d325a9fe899> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/179135fb-3cc7-3423-8a35-4aecf22ce411> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/430efdef-5a99-396c-bd67-2831bb14cd27> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/777f81f4-1d9d-3d20-97a8-e5fd4781be78> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/7169cd3f-0700-33a3-995a-db1e31a09d54> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/63264a0a-f4ce-380a-9530-b95356aeec73> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/38159528-494f-31c2-8c5a-4e09f5067b24> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/a2ba9ff8-2919-3b5c-8418-6afa08c8835c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f9dccaad-eecc-33e7-8ec6-ed2cff600999> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/52c6e224-841c-3d0a-a1a0-b614ac91d7e2> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1c851b60-c730-3559-9533-38fd4d7e79cf> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/098bd6b3-801f-39c4-bf65-69bfbff6c2ff> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Tapestry woven in silk and wool. On the right underneath a great hanging fastened to two columns sits Spring. She is elaborately dressed and holds a bunch of flowers in her right hand, and in her left is stretched out to a large bunch of flowers at her side. Round her are five women with bunches and baskets of flowers. On the extreme right is a large vase decorated with flowers, and in the background on the left is a party of men and women dancing round a maypole in an elaborate flower garden while others look on. A gardener is seen carrying out from a house a tree in a large tub."@en , "Tapestry woven in silk and wool, Brussels, ca. 1690-1720"@en ;
